 trade on where it lands.<p>I made this game! Some technical details:<p>The entire drop of the ball is simulated server-side, then streamed to each client as server-sent events with a small buffer. Every drop is deterministic from its starting position, so rounds can be replayed exactly for later analysis, but tiny variations in starting position can change the ultimate outcome.<p>There&#x27;s some AI traders to keep the market moving, but they drop out in any round that has more than five people. They operate using a naive set of rules that I wrote for them, so they&#x27;re not too hard to beat -- it&#x27;s when the market is full of real people that it gets tricky.<p>Curious to get feedback on anything you would change, and especially whether the mechanics were clear right away or not.", "title": "Show HN: bouncemarket – a live prediction market game for a bouncing ball", "updated_at": "2026-11-27T19:02:18Z", "url": "https://bouncemarket.minhanhday.com/"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "freakynit"}, "title": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "US Air Force's cloud computing platform hacked"}, "url": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "https://news.sky.com/story/us-air-forces-cloud-computing-platform-hacked-13617163"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_freakynit", "story_50666375", "front_page"], "author": "freakynit", "children": [50666850, 50666887, 50666933, 50666934, 50667030, 50667063, 50667065, 50667201, 50667418, 50667503, 50667622, 50667650, 50667677, 50667705, 50667962, 50667987, 50668373, 50668440, 50668761, 50669365, 50669563, 50669665], "created_at": "2026-11-27T12:54:11Z", "created_at_i": 1795784051, "num_comments": 151, "objectID": "50666375", "points": 244, "story_id": 50666375, "title": "US Air Force's cloud computing platform hacked", "updated_at": "2026-11-27T19:02:18Z", "url": "https://news.sky.com/story/us-air-forces-cloud-computing-platform-hacked-13617163"}, {"_h